�␀�*��*:h9���Z(��G��]�����|�^R�H-9���<K�˫��2�M���>�9��S��\>-L���I�-_�-�:��1�-B��|U���	��c��[A���J���X}����]�*A��F�u����%&�Z��a�Eh�:x�Ԛ_�����=�Sw���>=���ڕ7L(m!�}:t���	�&��Āۂ���V�0�}_���6Bh�ӹ����@1␀Q��$v`�$oyݾy:��ejH��2��=␀�␀␀␀␀␀␀APK Sig Block 42PK.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀���n(␀␀(␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀��␀␀␀␀AndroidManifest.xmlPK.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀��P␀␀P␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀��Y␀␀resources.arscPK.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀��X%{4␀{4␀%␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀���␀␀res/mipmap-xxxhdpi-v4/ic_launcher.pngPK.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀�,�̈U␀␀�U␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀���B␀classes.dexPK.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀F>*�V␀␀␀V␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀��K�␀assets/config.jsonPK.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀$�/!O␀␀O␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀��ј␀assets/NOTICE.txtPK.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀�len<��<��␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀��O�␀assets/www/StartEdito.htmlPK␀␀␀␀␀␀�␀␀�A�␀␀